msgstr "低于此速度由 SP 接管"

msgid "Sets cruise speed to the car's speed limit plus an offset. Needs openpilot longitudinal and the vehicle bus."
msgstr "按车辆识别的限速加偏移量设置巡航速度；需要 openpilot 纵向控制和车辆总线连接。"

