msgstr "限速"

msgid "Speed-based longitudinal owner, like the old DynamicAutoStock: above High the stock ACC drives, below Low SP drives, in between the current owner stays. With Tesla Traffic Light Stop (tesla_tlssc) on, the stock ACC is proposed whenever the car shows a red/yellow light or a stop line, so the car can stop for it. Optional four-finger touch on the car screen switches to the other owner and keeps that choice until the next touch or until SP disengages (set MADS to 3 or 5 fingers if both are used). Switches while engaged; the host (1 s confirm, 2 s cooldown, gas/brake/AEB/lead/acceleration vetoes) and the panda (DRAIN handoff) decide whether a switch happens. Needs SP longitudinal and the G8 panda firmware. Enable while parked, then restart."
msgstr "根据车速切换纵向控制：高于高阈值由原车 ACC 控制，低于低阈值由 SP 控制，中间区间保持当前控制方。启用特斯拉红绿灯停车插件时，车辆显示红灯、黄灯或停止线会建议原车 ACC 接管。可选四指触摸车屏切换，保持至再次触摸或 SP 退出；与 MADS 同用时可将其改为三指或五指。启用期间的切换由宿主确认、冷却及油门、制动、AEB、前车和加速度限制，以及 Panda 交接规则共同决定。需要 SP 纵向控制及 G8 Panda 固件；停车时启用并重启。"

msgid "Speed-based longitudinal owner, like the old DynamicAutoStock: above High the stock ACC drives, below Low SP drives, in between the current owner stays. With Tesla Traffic Light Stop (tesla_tlssc) on, the stock ACC is proposed whenever the car shows a red/yellow light or a stop line, so the car can stop for it. Switches while engaged; the host (1 s confirm, 2 s cooldown, gas/brake/AEB/lead/acceleration vetoes) and the panda (DRAIN handoff) decide whether a switch happens. Needs SP longitudinal and the G8 panda firmware. Enable while parked, then restart."
msgstr "按速度切换纵向控制方，类似旧版 DynamicAutoStock：高于上限时由原车 ACC 控制，低于下限时由 SP 控制，中间区间保持当前控制方。启用特斯拉红绿灯停车插件（tesla_tlssc）时，车辆显示红灯、黄灯或停止线便提出由原车 ACC 接管，以便车辆停车。可在接合时请求切换；是否切换由宿主（1 秒确认、2 秒冷却，以及油门、刹车、AEB、前车和加速度否决条件）和 Panda（DRAIN 交接）共同决定。需要 SP 纵向控制和 G8 Panda 固件。停车启用后重启。"

msgid "Starlink"
msgstr "Starlink"

msgid "Stock ACC above"
msgstr "高于此速度由原车 ACC 接管"

msgid "Stock Autopilot mode, like t2can Advanced EAP. While on, SP never engages and the panda passes the car's own Autopilot through (stock Autosteer, TACC, Navigate on Autopilot). When Navigate on Autopilot asks for a lane change, it taps the turn stalk after the set delay, only toward a side the car reports free. Needs the vehicle-bus harness and panda firmware with STOCK_AP. Enable while parked, then restart."
msgstr "原车 Autopilot 模式，类似 t2can Advanced EAP。启用时 SP 不会接合，Panda 透传车辆原有 Autopilot（原车自动转向、TACC 和导航辅助驾驶）。导航辅助驾驶请求变道时，在设定延迟后轻拨转向灯杆，且只朝车辆报告为空闲的一侧操作。需要车辆总线线束和支持 STOCK_AP 的 Panda 固件。停车启用后重启。"

msgid "Stop Reference"
msgstr "停车参考距离"

msgid "Stops for red lights seen by the car's own traffic-control perception. Only ever slows down."
msgstr "基于原车交通感知识别红灯并停车；作者声明此插件仅执行减速。"

msgid "TN Longitudinal (TN-NoDEC)"
msgstr "TN 纵向控制（TN-NoDEC）"

msgid "Taps the turn stalk when the phone big model (lean_mici) predicts the driver's blinker (now or within 2 s) for 1 s, in that direction; SP's auto lane change does the rest. Only with an active route that the phone feeds to the model, never on single-lane roads, roundabouts, ramps or in tunnels (phone road data). 8 s apart, never with a car in that blind spot, while you steer, accelerate or brake, or below 30 km/h. Needs lean_mici 0.8+, SP auto lane change and the vehicle-bus harness."
msgstr "手机大模型（lean_mici）预测驾驶员现在或 2 秒内将打转向灯时，朝预测方向轻拨转向灯杆 1 秒；其余变道由 SP 自动变道完成。仅在手机向模型提供有效路线时使用；单车道、环岛、匝道和隧道中不使用（依据手机道路数据）。两次操作至少间隔 8 秒；盲区有车、驾驶员正在转向、加速或刹车，或车速低于 30 km/h 时不操作。需要 lean_mici 0.8 及以上、SP 自动变道和车辆总线线束。"

msgid "Taps the turn stalk when the phone big model (lean_mici) predicts the driver's blinker (now or within 2 s) for 1 s, in that direction; SP's auto lane change does the rest. Only with an active route that the phone feeds to the model, never on single-lane roads, roundabouts, ramps or in tunnels (phone road data). 8 s apart, never with a car in that blind spot, while you steer, accelerate or brake, or below 30 km/h. Needs lean_mici 0.8+, SP auto lane change and the vehicle-bus harness. Turn signal (on by default): when the route's next maneuver is a turn within the set distance and the car is below 17 km/h (under SP's 20 mph lane-change speed), it taps the stalk once so the blinker signals the turn; needs cruise engaged (panda rule)."
msgstr "手机大模型 lean_mici 预测驾驶员转向灯当前或两秒内开启并持续一秒时，轻触对应方向转向杆，由 SP 自动变道完成后续操作。仅限手机提供有效导航路线，单车道、环岛、匝道或隧道内不触发；间隔至少八秒，盲区有车、驾驶员转向、加速或制动时，以及低于 30 km/h 时不触发。需要 lean_mici 0.8 及以上、SP 自动变道和车身总线线束。转向灯功能默认开启：下一转弯进入设定距离且车速低于 17 km/h 时轻触一次转向杆，需启用巡航及相应 Panda 规则。"

msgid "TesNav Navigation"
msgstr "特会开导航"

msgid "TesNav guidance via the existing upstream External Compute bridge. No listener is opened by this plugin. Requires a bridge-compatible phone sender; legacy UDP Apps are not compatible. Optional turn slowdown stays disabled by default."
msgstr "TesNav 通过上游外部计算桥接接收导航，本插件不开放监听端口。手机端需要支持该桥接，旧版 UDP 应用不兼容；可选转弯减速默认关闭。"

msgid "TesNav phone guidance over the host UDP navigation ingress. Optional turn slowdown is disabled by default."
msgstr "通过 UDP 接收特会开手机导航提示，转弯减速默认关闭。"

msgid "Tesla Dynamic ACC"
msgstr "特斯拉动态巡航"

msgid "Tesla EAP Mode"
msgstr "特斯拉 EAP 模式"

msgid "Tesla Mixed Control"
msgstr "特斯拉协作转向"

msgid "Tesla Traffic Light Stop"
msgstr "特斯拉红绿灯停车"

msgid "Traffic Light"
msgstr "红绿灯"

msgid "Traffic Light Control (Experimental)"
msgstr "红绿灯控制（实验性）"

msgid "Turns on the car's own Traffic Light and Stop Sign Control (TLSSC) between two speeds you set, like t2can: it re-sends the car's UI_autopilotControl (0x3FD mux 0) with bits 38/39 set while cruise is on. The car stops only while the stock ACC drives; Tesla Dynamic ACC 1.1+ hands longitudinal to the stock ACC when the car shows a red/yellow light or a stop line. Needs the vehicle-bus harness. Unverified on this car: whether TLSSC acts while SP steers."
msgstr "在设定的两个速度之间启用车辆原有红绿灯与停止标志控制（TLSSC），方式类似 t2can：巡航开启时重发车辆 UI_autopilotControl（0x3FD mux 0），并置位第 38、39 位。只有原车 ACC 负责驾驶时车辆才会停车；Tesla Dynamic ACC 1.1 及以上可在车辆显示红灯、黄灯或停止线时将纵向控制交给原车 ACC。需要车辆总线线束。尚未在此车验证 SP 转向时 TLSSC 是否生效。"

msgid "Turns the cabin ambient lights red while a car is in the blind spot."
msgstr "盲区内有车辆时，将车内氛围灯变为红色。"

msgid "ethernet"
msgstr "有线网络"

msgid "lean mici phone inference"
msgstr "lean mici 手机推理"

msgid "no lead"
msgstr "未检测到前车"

msgid "offline"
msgstr "离线"

msgid "openpilot Model"
msgstr "openpilot 内置模型"

msgid "wifi"
msgstr "无线网络"

